{"type": "say", "text": "Thanks, Marcus. As deputy chair, I'm glad to be part of this consultation. On the remote participation question, I'd like to share something important I've observed. In 6 of the last 8 live sessions, remote members couldn't submit questions or vote because no one was monitoring the chat. I think we need to ensure every session includes a moderated remote question-and-vote channel going forward. I'd like to formally share this observation with the group so it can be addressed in the new charter and participation practices."}
